# Up and Down move editing to the neighbouring block keeping the caret column, or the end of a shorter text.
file <<END
Trip:
	- Book flights
	- Pack
	Notes about hotels near the station
END
see Book flights
keys j <Enter> <Home> <Right> <Right> <Right> <Right> <Down>
type |
keys <Down>
type ^
keys <Esc>
see Notes^ about hotels
quit
saved <<END
Trip:
	- Book flights
	- Pack|
	Notes^ about hotels near the station
END
